WSync's sync engine (vfs, middleware, tree/snapshot/changes core, project
format, CLI tooling) is a fork of Argon 2.0.29. The vendored crates under
crates/ (config-derive, json-formatter, profiling, notify-debouncer-full,
self_update) retain their original licenses as noted in each crate.

WSync's product layer (desktop app, wire protocol, conflict engine, command
surface) is a clean-slate remake of Ro-Sync by Ro-Sync's own author.
